                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>A halo engagement ring has a center stone, like a diamond, surrounded by a circle of smaller diamonds or other gemstones, enhancing the central gem’s sparkle and size. This style adds a touch of glamour and is popular for its eye-catching brilliance.</p>",
